ch is the cost, not the answer. The assistant is fast; getting to the assistant is slow.",{"className":"text-base text-ink-2","children":"For students and knowledge workers, that switch is the cost, not the answer. The assistant is fast; getting to the assistant is slow."}],["$","p","There’s a second, quieter problem. An assistant that’s good at giving answers is very good at removing the need to understand them. For a student, that’s not a feature — it’s the failure mode.",{"className":"text-base text-ink-2","children":"There’s a second, quieter problem. An assistant that’s good at giving answers is very good at removing the need to understand them. For a student, that’s not a feature — it’s the failure mode."}]]}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"goal","className":"scroll-mt-28 border-t border-line pt-10 lg:pt-12","children":[["$","$L14",null,{"y":14,"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-mono uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3 flex items-center gap-3 text-ink-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"h-px w-7 shrink-0 bg-line-2"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"num","children":["02"," / ","09"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-[clamp(1.5rem,1.5vw+1.1rem,2.25rem)] font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.028em] text-ink","children":"Goal"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 max-w-[68ch]","children":["$","$L22",null,{"className":"space-y-9","stagger":0.06,"children":[["$","$L23","Product goal-0",{"y":12,"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-mono uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3 mb-3 text-ink-4","children":"Product goal"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-base text-ink-2","children":"Reduce the cost of asking to near zero — no window switch, no typing, no describing what’s already on screen — without turning the tool into something that does the work for you."}],null]}],["$","$L23","Success criteria-1",{"y":12,"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-mono uppercase trackin